{"meta":{"ui":"order_summary","model":"claude-haiku-5-5","form":"notation","designSystem":"cards","turn":"generate","prompt":"Show my grocery order as an inline card before you place it, with the number of items at the top. Five lines, each with a picture placeholder, its price and a quantity I can raise or lower (removing the line at zero): Bananas 1 kg $2.50 x1, Whole milk 2 L $3.20 x2, Sourdough loaf $4.50 x1, Free-range eggs $5.00 x1, Cheddar $7.00 x1. A promo code field where SAVE10 takes 10% off the subtotal, delivery of $4.99, and the subtotal, promo and total kept up to date as I change things. Confirm and cancel buttons that tell you what I decided.","text":"ChatCard \"Your grocery order\" \"5 items\" icon:\"shopping_cart\" status:\"Before you place it\" tone:accent\n  state items=[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Bananas\",\"detail\":\"1 kg\",\"price\":2.5,\"qty\":1,\"kind\":\"banana\"},{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"Whole milk\",\"detail\":\"2 L\",\"price\":3.2,\"qty\":2,\"kind\":\"milk\"},{\"id\":3,\"name\":\"Sourdough loaf\",\"detail\":\"Bakery\",\"price\":4.5,\"qty\":1,\"kind\":\"bread\"},{\"id\":4,\"name\":\"Free-range eggs\",\"detail\":\"12 pack\",\"price\":5.0,\"qty\":1,\"kind\":\"eggs\"},{\"id\":5,\"name\":\"Cheddar\",\"detail\":\"400 g\",\"price\":7.0,\"qty\":1,\"kind\":\"cheese\"}]\n  state promo=\"\"\n  state applied=false\n  state decision=\"\"\n  let itemCount = sum(map(items, i => i.qty))\n  let subtotal = sum(map(items, i => i.qty * i.price))\n  let discount = applied ? subtotal * 0.10 : 0\n  let delivery = 4.99\n  let total = subtotal - discount + delivery\n  SectionLabel \"Items\" \"{itemCount} items\"\n  each row in items\n    Row gap:10 center\n      Media kind:{row.kind} h:44 w:44\n      Column grow gap:2\n        Text.rowTitle \"{row.name}\"\n        Text.meta \"{row.detail} · {money(row.price,\"$\",2)}\"\n      Row gap:6\n        IconButton \"remove\" -> row.qty -= 1; if (row.qty <= 0) { items = removeWhere(items, x => x.id == row.id) }\n        Text.strong \"x{row.qty}\"\n        IconButton \"add\" -> row.qty += 1\n  Divider\n  Row gap:8\n    InputField \"Promo code\" \"SAVE10\" =promo -> applied = (trim(upper(promo)) == \"SAVE10\")\n    Text.meta \"{applied ? \"10% off applied\" : \"\"}\"\n  Details rows:[\"Subtotal\",\"{money(subtotal,\"$\",2)}\"],[\"Promo SAVE10\",\"{applied ? \"-\"+money(discount,\"$\",2) : \"\"}\"],[\"Delivery\",\"{money(delivery,\"$\",2)}\"] \n  TotalBar \"Total\" \"{itemCount} items\" amount:{money(total,\"$\",2)} cta:\"Place order\" -> decision=\"placed\"\n  Row gap:10\n    ActionButton \"Cancel\" quiet -> decision=\"cancelled\"; toast \"Order cancelled\"\n    ActionButton \"Confirm\" primary -> decision=\"confirmed\"; emit confirm_order; toast \"Order confirmed\"\n  if decision != \"\"\n    Receipt \"{decision == \"confirmed\" ? \"Order confirmed\" : \"Order cancelled\"}\" \"{decision == \"confirmed\" ? \"You decided to place this order.\" : \"You decided not to place this order.\"}\" tone:{decision == \"confirmed\" ? \"good\" : \"neutral\"} icon:{decision == \"confirmed\" ? \"check\" : \"close\"}","usage":{"input_tokens":9438,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1052,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard","output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0}},"ttftMs":559,"totalMs":4148}}
